<title>CANADA: Northern Telecom wins US$143 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Northern Telecom wins US$143 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Telecom Ltd said on Wednesday it won a US$143 million contract from BC Telecom Inc unit BC TEL to supply various telecommunications products and services over the next three years.</p>
<p>Under this deal, BC TEL can choose from products and services provided by two NorTel lines -- public carrier networks and broadband networks including a variety of switching, transmission and access products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
